---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Website Privacy" description="Privacy information for the RepoTunnel public website source included in this build.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>Website Privacy</span></div><span class="eyebrow">Website privacy</span><h1>Simple website, minimal data</h1><p class="lead">This website build contains no account system, advertising, analytics SDK, tracking pixel, marketing form or third-party font script.</p></div></section>
  <div class="container content-shell"><article class="prose">
    <section><h2>What this site code stores</h2><p>The site stores only a local color-theme preference in your browser's localStorage. Documentation search is performed in the browser against the site's own static search index.</p></section>
    <section><h2>External links and downloads</h2><p>GitHub links and download buttons take you to the official RepoTunnel GitHub repository or release assets. Those destinations have their own privacy policies.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Hosting provider</h2><p>If this static website is deployed through a hosting provider, that provider may process normal HTTP request metadata under its own terms. This website source does not add first-party tracking on top of that.</p></section>
  </article></div>
</BaseLayout>
